module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.store_refusal_reported_as_contention

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, decl_ref }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data store_refusal_reported_as_contention: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "store_refusal_reported_as_contention" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a conditional-write realization reports every unsuccessful write as a lost precondition, without observing that a competing publication actually defeated the expectation. HARM: permission, capacity, or IO refusal becomes ordinary contention; the caller re-evaluates and retries against a phantom winner while the operational deficit disappears from its own refusal channel. This is the DESIGN section 5 refusal-as-contention widen, not a missing shared outcome.",

    "SPECIMEN, REPAIRED (silent-stag-307): cas_commit_at previously mapped every unsuccessful WriteOwnerOnly to CasPreconditionFailed via cas_probe_as_readable, including ProbedBeyondBound-as-absent. Publication now folds Filesystem.WriteCreateNew through filesystem_create_new. CasPreconditionFailed is emitted only for FilesystemCreateTargetOccupied together with a readable winner. Permission, other, unrecognized kinds, and occupied-with-no-readable-winner are CasStoreRefused. No error string is parsed. Observe uses cas_probe_as_observation, which preserves unreadability.",

    "EXECUTED, PUBLICATION LAYER (not this class's partition): cargo test --release -p v1-compiler --lib write_file_create_new on BuildBuddy amd64. a_write_failure_after_creation_leaves_no_target_behind: RLIMIT_FSIZE after staging begins leaves no final path. concurrent_same_target_creates_produce_one_winner_and_no_residue: one exclusive create wins. direct_final_path_open_then_write_leaves_a_target_when_the_write_fails: the retired open-then-write construction stays RED. Those three do not classify CasStoreRefused versus CasPreconditionFailed.",

    "EXECUTED, THIS CLASS, HERMETIC FOLD: required-witnesses-floor GitHub Actions run 34797864081 (and 34800475614) standing=planned-and-passed for test.claim.durable_cas_file_store_witness a_permission_refused_create_is_store_refused_not_contention, occupied_create_with_no_readable_winner_is_store_refused_not_contention, occupied_create_with_a_readable_winner_is_precondition_failed, classifying_every_failed_publication_as_contention_turns_the_store_refusal_control_red. Those four mock the filesystem; they do not prove the composition.",

    "EXECUTED, THIS CLASS, COMPOSITION: the same runs' D0-MEASURE local-repo wet lane, [local-repo-wet] expected=passed observed=passed, scheduled=61 admitted=61 refusals=0. Identities: commit_then_independent_read_back_agrees_by_real_execution, a_second_eligible_writer_loses_to_the_observed_winner_by_real_execution, an_advance_after_commit_lands_generation_two_by_real_execution, a_non_contention_store_refusal_is_not_precondition_failed_by_real_execution. Run 34797864081 then failed D0-ADJUDICATE on unenrolled hermetic DirWithTemplate route-gaps; that red does not retract the wet terminals. Hermetic envelope for those four is NO-ROUTE; floor_route_gap_expectation_chunk_11 records that gap and does not stand in for the wet receipt.",

    "THIS SESSION DID NOT EXECUTE THE .dag CELLS: claim_batch OOM during corpus resolve at about 7GiB (SIGKILL 137). That is the session container, not the local-repo wet lane. The executing consumer of the four composition cells is required-floor D0-MEASURE local-repo-wet, which did reach them.",

    "RUNG FOUND AT BY EXECUTION: mechanically preventable at the classification fold, at the grain of the floor receipts above. Ceiling remains mechanically preventable at the external store boundary; crash-durable directory metadata is a different class.",

    "CEILING: mechanically preventable at the external store boundary; the internal occupied-versus-refused partition is construction in cas_outcome_from_create. NEXT TRIGGER: Filesystem.Read absence versus unreadability already inhabits filesystem_exact_read and is consumed by cas_probe_from_exact; remaining ceiling is crash-durable visibility, which this class does not own.",

    "FABRIC CONSUMER: gunbc.fabric_control_plane reserve_selected_cell maps CasPreconditionFailed to ReservationLost and CasStoreRefused to StoreUnavailable. Before this repair an unwritable store reported ReservationLost. After it, operational faults are StoreUnavailable. A genuine occupied slot is still ReservationLost. That is the observable change, and it is the defect closing rather than a silent shift of a correct race.",

    "CONSUMPTION: the derived gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.roster recurring_failure_mode_roster includes this per-class declaration.",
  ],

  evidence: [
    decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.durable_cas_file_store", decl_name: "cas_outcome_from_create"),
    decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.durable_cas_file_store", decl_name: "cas_outcome_from_create_widening_every_failure_to_contention"),
    decl_ref(module_path: "test.claim.durable_cas_file_store_witness", decl_name: "a_permission_refused_create_is_store_refused_not_contention"),
    decl_ref(module_path: "test.claim.durable_cas_file_store_wet_witness", decl_name: "a_non_contention_store_refusal_is_not_precondition_failed_by_real_execution"),
  ],
}
